Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.17,0:00:04.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.32,0:00:07.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这俩就是约翰·温彻斯特的孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think these are John Winchester's boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.81,0:00:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫埃伦  这是我女儿  乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm Ellen. That's my daughter, Jo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.34,0:00:13.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真该狠狠揍你一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can of whup ass I ought to open on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:15.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你最好给我电话设个快捷键  -遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You better put me on speed dial, kid. - Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.33,0:00:17.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面那些可是地狱犬  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are hellhounds out there, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.23,0:00:18.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们放狗进来  你们趁机溜到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We let the dogs in, you guys make a break
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:20.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,旁边那栋楼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the building next over,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:22.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以在这里准备引爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can wait here with my finger on the button.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:23.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若我能为大家争取到杀掉路西法的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can get us a shot on the devil,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.03,0:00:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就要好好把握\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.83,0:00:26.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让你一个人留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will not leave you here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.67,0:00:34.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-上面正在进行内战  -我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's civil war up there! - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.07,0:00:36.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果能打败拉斐尔  就能结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can beat Raphael, we can end this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:37.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不仅仅是叛变\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did more than rebel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.99,0:00:39.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你撕毁了整个剧本\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tore up the whole script
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.31,0:00:41.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,改变了我们所有人的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}and burned the pages for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.01,0:00:43.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道灵魂价值几何吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what souls are worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.34,0:00:44.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道它们有多大力量吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What power they hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.87,0:00:46.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见过这个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.36,0:00:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-鲁弗斯·特纳  -没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rufus turner? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:48.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没要你帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't asking for no help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.68,0:00:49.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从没见过这混混\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seen that dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.73,0:00:51.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又没求你批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking for your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:52.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像以前一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:00:54.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车要我来开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long as I get to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.02,0:00:58.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你是什么  -夏娃把我造出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you? - Eve cooked me up herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.52,0:01:00.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mother of all of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:03.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她让我捎句话给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}she has a message for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.49,0:01:10.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.53,0:01:25.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.79,0:01:28.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(宾夕法尼亚州  切斯特)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.19,0:01:46.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是破烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Piece of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:01.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.63,0:02:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第6季第17集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.70,0:03:20.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.47,0:03:22.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.79,0:03:24.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.06,0:03:39.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩是打算像毕业舞会上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two just gonna stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.58,0:03:42.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个丑妹子一样傻站着  还是过来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}like the ugly girl at the prom, or you gonna pitch in?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.38,0:03:46.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这什么夏娃  什么之母\N{\fnArial\fs30}This so-called Eve, mother, whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:47.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不会自己乖乖消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}ain't gonna gank herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.40,0:03:50.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.47,0:03:53.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  你好几天没睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, you haven't slept in days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.88,0:03:56.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有睡  你干嘛  扮我老婆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sleep. What are you, my wife now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.49,0:03:59.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying that, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.85,0:04:01.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休息一下会比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking five might be a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.65,0:04:02.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对谁好\N{\fnArial\fs30}For whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.17,0:04:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Bobby,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.96,0:04:06.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那事对我们来说都不好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was -- it was tough for all of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.92,0:04:09.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲁弗斯就这么走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing Rufus go like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.25,0:04:10.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.59,0:04:14.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这跟鲁弗斯没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't about Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:16.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  他不仅仅只是个牌友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, he wasn't just a poker buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.11,0:04:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早就知道鲁弗斯会完蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know when I knew Rufus was done for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:20.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遇见他那天起我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day I met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.18,0:04:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唯一的问题是  他和我谁先玩儿完\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only question was, who first -- him or me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.34,0:04:25.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是准备站在那里继续跟我谈心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you want to stand there and therapize,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.08,0:04:26.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是去给我弄点咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you want to get me some coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.99,0:04:29.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要爱尔兰式的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it Irish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.98,0:04:35.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可真好的不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's doing fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.65,0:04:37.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  跟鲁弗斯完全无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. This isn't about Rufus at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.26,0:04:39.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.53,0:04:42.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可不能眼睁睁看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we can't just sit here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.10,0:04:43.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把肝喝爆吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and watch him poop out his liver.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.87,0:04:45.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以让他出去走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we could get him out of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.95,0:04:47.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:48.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的  是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? what do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.48,0:04:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.92,0:04:53.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宾夕法尼亚州的切斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chester, Pennsylvania.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:55.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上周死了三个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three people got kicked off in the last week,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.08,0:04:57.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死法都很诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}all freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.03,0:04:59.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上一个死的人被自己车库门斩首了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last guy got karate-chopped by his garage door.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:01.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且这些人都是血亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these are all blood relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你怎么想  家族诅咒吗  -可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you thinking, family curse? - Could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.28,0:05:05.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂  火爆男...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, grumpy --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:08.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.01,0:05:10.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我啥都不想干  别烦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to do crap. Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.50,0:05:14.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开我家就是了  你俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...get out of my house, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.47,0:05:16.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可闹心死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're driving me nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:17.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.43,0:05:19.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:21.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我嘞个去\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the love of pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.47,0:05:44.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们应该等到她回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, maybe we should wait till she gets back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:46.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  她刚在路上打了电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, she just called from the road,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.95,0:05:48.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说她还两步就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}said she'd be here in "Two shakes."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.73,0:05:49.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真想呆在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really want to sit around
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.46,0:05:50.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闻他的酒气  看他自怨自艾么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and smell him stew in his juices?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.99,0:05:52.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  开车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. Drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.44,0:06:08.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.51,0:06:10.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别告诉我你一直在喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you haven't been drinking this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.11,0:06:13.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你比那俩兄弟还烦  我工作呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're worse than the boys. I'm working.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.47,0:06:14.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.17,0:06:16.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就离开一星期  这地方就这德行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gone a week, and this place goes completely to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.19,0:06:19.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你犯什么病  鲍比·辛格\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with you, Bobby Singer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.65,0:06:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿好笔  要记的可多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a pen. It's a long list.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.85,0:06:24.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你闻起来就像个酒吧  知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smell like a bar, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.95,0:06:27.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你闻起来也没那么香\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't exactly smell like a rose yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:28.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我一直在和乔猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. Yeah, I been hunting with Jo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:30.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又因为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your excuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:32.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非要说的话  我倒有个不错的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I need one, I got a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.29,0:06:39.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:41.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.44,0:06:43.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他对我也很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}He meant a lot to me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.09,0:06:49.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梳洗一下  我弄点吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go wash up. I'll fix us something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.31,0:06:52.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人说过你很烦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody ever tell you you're a pain in the ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:57.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你才会娶我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you married me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.46,0:06:59.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:02.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别对我指手画脚的  埃伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me what to do, Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.44,0:07:08.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(宾夕法尼亚州  切斯特)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.38,0:07:20.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全没反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a bleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.15,0:07:22.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就说不是复仇鬼魂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not a vengeful spirit, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:25.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.93,0:07:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到啥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatcha got?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.05,0:07:45.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么  圣诞节装饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that, christmas tinsel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.56,0:07:46.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.00,0:07:57.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是金的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.31,0:07:58.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说  黄金那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, like, gold gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.48,0:08:01.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么一个杂工的车库里会随地扔金子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would a handyman have gold just lying around in his garage?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.13,0:08:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.36,0:08:06.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们家族绝对有不可告人的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is definitely a skeleton in this family's closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.47,0:08:10.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世上哪儿有那么巧合的意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, accidents don't just happen accidentally.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.90,0:08:12.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.17,0:08:15.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  不如我去查家族档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. How about I'll go check family records,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.99,0:08:17.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你走访下近亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}you go with next of kin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.79,0:08:18.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.82,0:08:24.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是司法程序  为了证词呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the courthouse steps -- for the deposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.63,0:08:26.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我说过了  下午3点\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I told you, 3:00 P.M.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.10,0:08:28.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  按常价收费\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, my usual fees.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:30.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得挂了  妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to go, ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.43,0:08:35.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  您是哪个部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Uh, what department?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:37.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,系谱学  大学里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genealogy. From the university.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.27,0:08:39.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在做一项关于本地家族的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-w-we're doing a study on local families,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.13,0:08:40.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲁索可是大家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, well, the Russos are a big one...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.29,0:08:41.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说吧  我只能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know what? I got to tell you, 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在特别忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am extremely busy right now, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.87,0:08:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解  你这周很不好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I-I'm sure you've had a rough week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:46.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到了前阵那些惨剧的报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, read about the recent tragedies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.96,0:08:48.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你的堂亲吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your cousins, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.94,0:08:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:52.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我跟他们走得不是很近  所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not that close with my family, so, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.27,0:08:55.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要很长时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this gonna take long?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.59,0:08:57.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会  5分钟  5分钟就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Five minutes. Five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.20,0:08:58.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能跟我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, can you -- can you tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.27,0:09:00.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲁索家有什么值得关注的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything noteworthy about the Russos?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.22,0:09:03.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,值得关注吗  没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noteworthy? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.47,0:09:05.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不是不值一提  就很普通啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, not exactly -- average,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.26,0:09:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家族  意大利裔\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, big, from Italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.41,0:09:07.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.98,0:09:12.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人在战争或者其他暴力事件中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, was anyone ever killed or maimed in a war
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.50,0:09:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死去或致残吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}or... you know, some other violent thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.31,0:09:18.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.84,0:09:22.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是黑历史  会玷污后代名声的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like something so dark that it would sully future generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.10,0:09:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:28.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.80,0:09:31.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人拥有过黑奴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone own a slave?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:33.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.82,0:09:35.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,常规问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Routine question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.52,0:09:37.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟纳粹党有过瓜葛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any ties to the Nazi party?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.24,0:09:38.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.95,0:09:40.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祖母开罪过吉普赛人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did grandma ever piss off a Gypsy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.68,0:09:44.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  打住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.49,0:09:45.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不管你这做的是什么研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what kind of study you're doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都给我到此为止  劳您大驾...\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's over right now, so, if you don't mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.91,0:09:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是直说了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I-I'll just cut to the chase here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.61,0:09:53.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, your life is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.97,0:09:55.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  这算什么  威胁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What is that, a-a threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.85,0:09:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在威胁我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you threatening me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.80,0:09:58.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没  没没没有  我不是在威胁你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. No, no. I'm not threatening you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.61,0:10:00.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just simply saying that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.81,0:10:03.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不留神  就会死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't watch your back, you're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.82,0:10:05.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从我办公室里滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell out of my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.85,0:10:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好吧  -马上滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.24,0:10:13.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-喂  -萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.73,0:10:15.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有线索吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.67,0:10:17.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到衣冠二货一只  你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}One ass-hat in a shiny suit. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:20.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不多  曾祖父母生于卡拉布里亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much. Great grandparents born in Calabria.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:23.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1912年移民到此定居\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emigrated 1912. Been here ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.81,0:10:25.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然跟黑手党没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, no severed horse head?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.13,0:10:27.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四代人都种花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha. Four generations of picket fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.14,0:10:30.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是他家历史这么清白\N{\fnArial\fs30}If these people are the Waltons,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.04,0:10:31.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会批量横死\N{\fnArial\fs30}then why the hell are they dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.83,0:10:37.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那古巴怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how about Cuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:38.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在那边风景正好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.93,0:10:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有新建的赌场度假城哦  特赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the new trump casino -- amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.68,0:10:44.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心孩子  那有冲浪池\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about the kids. There's a wave pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题  好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Sure, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:06.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你喜欢雪茄  雪利酒或者马戏表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you like cigars, cher, or the circus,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:08.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈瓦那就是最佳选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all about Havana.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.71,0:11:14.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  夏特纳的广告我看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I've seen the Shatner ads.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.49,0:11:15.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你知道他们欠缺什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what they don't have?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.99,0:11:17.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,深心接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personal touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.72,0:11:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  我会把具体细节邮件给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then. I'll e-mail you some details.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.46,0:11:23.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.26,0:12:59.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安妮·韦萍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne Witting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.63,0:13:01.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确定她不是鲁索家亲戚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sure she's not a Russo,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.07,0:13:03.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许是七舅老爷的外甥女呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}a second cousin twice removed or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.49,0:13:06.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我查过两次  她跟他们没有血缘关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I checked the records twice. She's not related.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:11.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是家族诅咒  那又是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, if this isn't a family curse, then what the hell is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.82,0:13:12.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问住我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.69,0:13:14.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全没头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.03,0:13:20.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:28.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到一条线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:34.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们又发现一根\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we found another piece of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.69,0:13:36.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种小亮线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, shiny string.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:37.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正担心这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.80,0:13:38.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.76,0:13:41.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全国都出现了这种所谓的意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, these so-called accidents -- we're seeing 'em nationwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.04,0:13:43.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前大概有75桩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 75 so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.94,0:13:46.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔她们正在加利福尼亚调查其中一批\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got Jo and her crew working on a cluster in California.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.60,0:13:48.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是血亲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood relatives?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:50.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些是  有些不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some yeah, some no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.56,0:13:53.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的发现跟你们类似\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got about what you do...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.13,0:13:55.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死人一堆  金线一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}pile of bodies and a whole bunch of gold thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:57.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-到底什么意思  -不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So what's it mean? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.42,0:13:59.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比正在查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got Bobby working on it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.27,0:14:02.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便问一声  他怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's he doing, by the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.04,0:14:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.91,0:14:06.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正把他踹向健康快乐的轨道上去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kicking his ass back to health and happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.83,0:14:08.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁求你来着  狗拿耗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who asked you to? To hell with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.61,0:14:10.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.35,0:14:12.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.22,0:14:14.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.46,0:14:15.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝  真贴心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, honey, you're sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.99,0:14:18.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你了解我的  我担心的是你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me. I just worry about you boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.33,0:14:21.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  这些死者\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, all these corpses...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.81,0:14:22.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么共同点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything relate 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.97,0:14:24.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我查到一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually, I did dig up one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.24,0:14:26.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是不清楚该作何解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't know what to make of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.92,0:14:27.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.79,0:14:30.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很诡异的一件事  不容易发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a weird one, and it was buried pretty deep,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.07,0:14:32.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我和鲍比查死者族谱的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Bobby and me were combing through
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.79,0:14:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逐渐发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}the family trees on all the victims, and we started seeing,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.69,0:14:39.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些家庭都在同一年到的美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the families all came over to America the same year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.57,0:14:40.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  1912年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. 1912.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.55,0:14:41.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但更奇怪的地方是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here's the real weird part --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.95,0:14:43.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们坐的是同一艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}they all came over on the same boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.60,0:14:45.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-真的  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.91,0:14:48.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那这艘船有什么特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so what's so special about the boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.21,0:14:49.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么特别  就是一艘船  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. It was a boat. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.35,0:14:50.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和普通的船没两样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It did what boats do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.51,0:14:52.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这艘船叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.60,0:14:55.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰坦尼克  你听说过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Titanic. You ever hear of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:57.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.59,0:14:58.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.62,0:15:00.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会继续查的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.60,0:15:01.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.06,0:15:07.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道泰坦尼克吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does the name Titanic ring a bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.11,0:15:09.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰坦尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Titanic?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.37,0:15:13.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.55,0:15:19.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皇家邮轮泰坦尼克号\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The RMS Titanic
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.62,0:15:22.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是当时世界上最大的客轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}"was the largest passenger steamship in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.22,0:15:23.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在1912年进行了首航\N{\fnArial\fs30}"when it made its maiden voyage
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.28,0:15:25.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,横跨了北大西洋\N{\fnArial\fs30}across the north Atlantic in 1912."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.55,0:15:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有啥大不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's the big friggin' deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.50,0:15:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一艘船  开航很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a ship. It sailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:30.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.78,0:15:34.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有过一场虚惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, looks like there was a close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.53,0:15:36.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轮船差点撞上冰山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ship almost hit an iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.15,0:15:37.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差点  然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost? So?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.82,0:15:39.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.79,0:15:41.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像大副及时发现了冰山\N{\fnArial\fs30}looks like the first mate spotted it just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.93,0:15:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干得不错嘛  还有什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for him. There anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.33,0:15:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.77,0:15:48.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.91,0:15:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个大副  I.P.斐利先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, this first mate -- Mr. I.P. Freeley.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.06,0:15:55.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这有啥好怀疑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's not suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.82,0:15:57.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能找到斐利以前的照片吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a picture of old Freeley?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.78,0:16:00.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.76,0:16:04.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坑爹呢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:06.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.98,0:16:13.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴尔萨泽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balthazar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.29,0:16:32.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两位小哥  有什么可以效劳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys, boys, boys. Whatever can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.52,0:16:33.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.97,0:16:35.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你看起来很心烦啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you seem upset, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.62,0:16:37.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴尔萨泽  那艘船是怎么回事  \N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell with the boat, Balthazar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.22,0:16:37.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么船\N{\fnArial\fs30}What boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.99,0:16:39.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰坦尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Titanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:41.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对哈  泰坦尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. The Titanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.89,0:16:45.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来是要沉没的  但是被我救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, uh, it was meant to sink, and I saved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.02,0:16:47.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.63,0:16:50.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来是要撞上冰山\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was meant to bash into this iceberg thing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.67,0:16:53.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带着一船人沉入海底\N{\fnArial\fs30}and plunge into the briny deep with all this hoopla,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:54.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是被我救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I saved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.92,0:16:56.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有什么疑惑需要解答吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else I can answer for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:16:57.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.69,0:16:58.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.51,0:17:00.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要救这艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you un-sink the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.25,0:17:02.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我讨厌那部电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, because I hated the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.55,0:17:04.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么电影  -这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What movie? - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.89,0:17:08.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你救这艘轮船的原因是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so you saved a cruise liner because...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.77,0:17:10.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为席琳·迪翁那首坑爹的歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that god-awful Celine Dion song
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.91,0:17:12.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我想自挂东南枝\N{\fnArial\fs30}made me want to smite myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.39,0:17:13.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁是席琳·迪翁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Celine Dion?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.89,0:17:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是魁北克某个酒吧的穷歌手 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she's a destitute lounge singer somewhere in Quebec,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.13,0:17:17.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  就让她继续这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let's keep it that way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.11,0:17:20.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我觉得不太可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I didn't think that was possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:22.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你无法改变历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you couldn't change history.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.23,0:17:24.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们没注意到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, haven't you noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.30,0:17:25.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们  规矩已经都废了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no more rules, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.29,0:17:31.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你胆子可真大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nerve on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:35.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就这样  救了一艘巨轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you just, what, un-sunk a giant boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.13,0:17:36.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  我可是救了人命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. I saved people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.89,0:17:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不是喜欢救人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you loved that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:40.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在  那些人的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but now those people and their kids
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.14,0:17:41.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的子子孙孙\N{\fnArial\fs30}and their kids' kids --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.04,0:17:44.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经和千千万万的人产生了联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must have interacted with so many other people,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.57,0:17:46.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,改变了很多事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}changed so much crap,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.70,0:17:48.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的一个举动完全改变了历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}you totally butterfly-effected history!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.57,0:17:49.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老弟  老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude. Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:51.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,规则一  不准提到库奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rule one, no Kutcher references.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.34,0:17:54.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很不幸  艾什顿·库奇(《蝴蝶效应》男主角)还是存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes. Unfortunately, there's still an Ashton Kutcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.79,0:17:54.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.38,0:17:56.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们依然阻止了天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you still averted the apocalypse,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.01,0:17:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大天使依旧存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there are still archangels.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:18:00.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,改变的只是一些小细节而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the small details that are different,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:03.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如你们开的车不是黑斑羚\N{\fnArial\fs30}like you don't drive an Impala.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.72,0:18:06.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要问"黑斑羚是什么"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes. "What's an Impala?"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:08.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  这不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, it's not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.95,0:18:11.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有  埃伦和乔都活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, of course, Ellen and Jo are alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.28,0:18:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃伦和乔  怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen and Jo? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.07,0:18:15.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们本应该死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, they're supposed to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.32,0:18:20.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我救了一艘船  一件事引发另一件\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I save a boat, one thing leads to another,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.01,0:18:21.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样产生连锁效应\N{\fnArial\fs30}which leads to another thousand things,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.66,0:18:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等诸如此类\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yada, yada, yada.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:24.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长话短说\N{\fnArial\fs30}To cut a long story short,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.59,0:18:26.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不用死于那场大爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}they don't die in a massive explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.64,0:18:31.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样  就算我做了一件好事吧  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, let's agree I did a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.89,0:18:32.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少了一部比利·赞恩的电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}One less Billy Zane movie,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.98,0:18:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还救了你们最好的两个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I saved two of your closest friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.77,0:18:37.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在有人在追杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now somebody is killing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.67,0:18:39.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些幸存者的后代\N{\fnArial\fs30}the descendants of the survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.89,0:18:41.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.73,0:18:46.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概有五万人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's maybe like 50,000 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.77,0:18:48.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.37,0:18:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须尽最大努力去救人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we need to save as many as we can,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.65,0:18:52.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们得知道谁在追杀他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we need to know who's after 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.14,0:18:53.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.58,0:18:55.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们把我当成另外一个天使了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have me confused with the other angel --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.81,0:18:57.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个穿着脏兮兮的风衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, the one in the dirty trenchcoat
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.23,0:18:58.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱你爱得死去活来的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.44,0:18:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.60,0:19:00.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.91,0:19:04.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见  孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.97,0:19:06.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.95,0:19:08.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.64,0:19:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴尔萨泽救了一艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Balthazar un-sank a boat,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.40,0:19:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就冒出来一整船\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now we got a boatload of people
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.00,0:19:15.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本不该出生的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who should never have been born.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.14,0:19:18.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  大概有五万人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Like 50,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.17,0:19:19.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就说得通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.28,0:19:21.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这哪儿说的通了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does any of this make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.87,0:19:24.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我知道我们的对手是谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I got an idea who we're up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.12,0:19:24.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:25.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.96,0:19:27.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.51,0:19:29.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说命运之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean fate, like the fates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.04,0:19:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起码是其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or one of 'em, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.05,0:19:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是说希腊神话中的命运三女神么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean like greek mythology? Like the sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.81,0:19:36.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.82,0:19:37.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,书呆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nerd.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.05,0:19:39.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们的职责就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}These ladies are responsible
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.46,0:19:42.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,编织你的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}for how you go down, literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:45.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  如果有人被车库门压扁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you get creamed by a garage door
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.32,0:19:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者被打印机绞死\N{\fnArial\fs30}or crunched by a copy machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.10,0:19:50.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而这些死法的细节都是由她们设计\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're the ones who hammer out the details of how you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.55,0:19:53.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你的命运纺到一块纯金里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spin out your fate on a piece of pure gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.38,0:19:55.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,金线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gold thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.56,0:19:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后其中一个会把这些都记录在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then one of 'em writes it all down
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.60,0:20:01.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的死亡记录本上\N{\fnArial\fs30}in her day runner of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.40,0:20:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高级的\N{\fnArial\fs30}High-level stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.41,0:20:05.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正  很符合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway -- fits.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.20,0:20:07.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们知道巴尔萨泽曾经做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we know what Balthazar did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.29,0:20:08.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems to me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.14,0:20:11.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能命运之神在收拾这烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}that maybe fate is just trying to clean up the mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.63,0:20:14.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们怎么制止她呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how do we stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.22,0:20:17.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何阻止命运  问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we stop fate? Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.45,0:20:18.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定会有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's got to be a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:19.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是没呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or there ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.51,0:20:21.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在讨论的可是命运女神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this is fate we're talking about here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.42,0:20:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最简单的方法就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the easiest way would be
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.60,0:20:26.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让那天使把那船弄沉\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get that angel to re-sink the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.43,0:20:28.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能  想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No way. Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.42,0:20:29.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惨死和根本不出生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big difference
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.19,0:20:31.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这两者可有很大区别  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}between dying awful and never being born, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.75,0:20:34.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  我们不能让船沉没\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not sinking the boat, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.15,0:20:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到没  想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.30,0:20:38.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你小子急个什么劲儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, okay. What's got your panties in a clench?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.92,0:20:40.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.66,0:20:43.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还想蒙我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.94,0:20:46.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.15,0:20:49.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  这没什么关系  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it -- it -- it doesn't even really matter, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.77,0:20:51.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:20:58.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很明显  如果泰坦尼克沉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, a crap-load of dominoes get tipped over
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.06,0:21:00.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么情况就会全部反过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}if the titanic goes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.00,0:21:04.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果就是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, bottom line...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.14,0:21:07.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃伦和乔都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Ellen and Jo die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.00,0:21:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  你们俩个听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you two. Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.69,0:21:31.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要确保\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.52,0:21:34.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不能让那些天使弄沉那艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep those angels from sinking that boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.92,0:21:36.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.36,0:21:37.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.09,0:21:38.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Bobby, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.97,0:21:49.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有她在  他还这德行呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's bad enough with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.88,0:21:51.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是她不在  他得成什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think how he'd be if she was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.73,0:21:53.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.99,0:21:57.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.19,0:22:01.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是  我们怎么救五万人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how do we save 50,000 people?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.58,0:22:04.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全没头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no freakin' clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.54,0:22:07.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们连他们是谁都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We don't even know who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.00,0:22:10.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一个我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we know one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.24,0:22:14.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.56,0:22:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是他  走\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's him. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.54,0:22:33.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.47,0:22:34.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.18,0:22:35.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲁索先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Russo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.57,0:22:37.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不管  给他送个水果蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care. Send him a fruitcake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.69,0:22:45.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-肖恩  -谁是法官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shawn! - Who's the judge?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.04,0:22:46.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲁索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.31,0:22:49.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好  送他瓶上好的香槟好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, send him a nice bottle of champagne.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.18,0:22:51.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是别超过30块  啊不  20块就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nothing more than $30 -- ah, no. 20 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.77,0:22:53.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  这家伙欠我个人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, this guy -- he owes me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.51,0:22:55.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲁索  停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russo, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.68,0:23:06.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.13,0:23:09.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有你  不是告你别来找我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you -- I told you to leave me alone, didn't I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.60,0:23:10.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我们只是想帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're just trying to help you out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.95,0:23:13.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我  你们差点害死我  你个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me?! You almost killed me, you lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.16,0:23:15.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿来  真是难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that. Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.76,0:23:16.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲁索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russo! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.75,0:23:18.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没起诉你够不错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be glad I'm not suing your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.44,0:23:33.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.25,0:23:40.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.79,0:23:41.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.82,0:23:43.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(免费咨询  人身伤害以及异常死亡)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.60,0:23:47.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不太合适吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.41,0:23:48.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.14,0:23:50.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定才过六秒确实不太合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure six seconds is too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.10,0:24:05.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂  喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.19,0:24:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像看到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I saw her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.50,0:24:08.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.65,0:24:10.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她  命运女神吗  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Her? Like fate her?  -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.01,0:24:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd she look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.35,0:24:14.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来像是图书馆员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like a librarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.46,0:24:18.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你那种  还是我那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your kind of librarian or my kind of librarian?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.34,0:24:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  她穿着衣服呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she was wearing clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.80,0:24:23.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你是想问这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}if that's what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.21,0:24:23.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.85,0:24:26.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  我们不能就这么过去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. We can't just walk over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.33,0:24:27.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们又不在追杀名单里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not on the hit list.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.95,0:24:29.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那船跟我们没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have nothing to do with the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.15,0:24:30.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去和她谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.15,0:24:31.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.09,0:24:32.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.17,0:24:36.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谈谈而已  值得一试  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk. Worth a shot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.04,0:24:47.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.39,0:25:52.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.95,0:26:01.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.30,0:26:02.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有打火机吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a lighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.44,0:26:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.16,0:26:12.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说  没气儿了还是怎么着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. It's out of juice or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.19,0:26:14.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不应该啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It shouldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.97,0:26:28.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.55,0:26:30.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们好  迪恩  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dean. Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.12,0:26:32.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  干的漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, nice man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.27,0:26:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.71,0:26:35.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白俄罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}White Russia.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.24,0:26:37.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.63,0:26:42.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你那兄弟都做了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you aware of what your frat bro did?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.65,0:26:46.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  巴尔萨泽是有点冲动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm aware. Balthazar can be impetuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.44,0:26:47.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, riddle me this --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.73,0:26:49.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果命运女神的目标是和船有关的那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If fate's going after the boat people,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.21,0:26:50.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又为何要杀我和萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}why'd she try to waste me and Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.73,0:26:52.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想她对你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I imagine she harbors
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.68,0:26:54.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心怀一定程度的痛恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}a certain degree of rage toward you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.84,0:26:55.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们做错什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.86,0:26:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么大不了的  不过就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing of import -- just the tiny matter
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.10,0:27:02.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻止天启  导致她再无用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}of averting the apocalypse and rendering her obsolete.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.10,0:27:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想她对此有点恼羞成怒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think maybe she's a little irritated about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.42,0:27:08.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你们俩还主动送上门\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you go and dangle yourselves in front of her...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.46,0:27:12.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来命运女神和我们是有私仇啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we've pissed fate off personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.32,0:27:14.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就我对她的了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I know her -- and I do --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.64,0:27:16.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不见你们俩尸骨她不会善罢甘休\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won't stop until you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.02,0:27:18.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.29,0:27:21.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.87,0:27:22.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.53,0:27:26.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀死命运女神吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.03,0:27:29.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有何高见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have another suggestion?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.39,0:27:32.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我  意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm -- I just mean, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.32,0:27:33.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命运女神杀得死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you even do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.96,0:27:35.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴尔萨泽有能对付她的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balthazar has a weapon that will work against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.93,0:27:36.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he does. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.97,0:27:38.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找他就找对人了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, that guy's just got it covered, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.57,0:27:40.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得交些新朋友  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need new friends, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.09,0:27:43.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这是在救我朋友的命  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to save the ones I have, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.40,0:27:48.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得诱她出动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to draw her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.58,0:27:51.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然她想伺机加害我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, uh, she's gunning for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.41,0:27:53.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到头来肯定会再露面\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's bound to surface again eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.71,0:27:57.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就帮她一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll make it easy for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.82,0:27:59.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用你们的话说  就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you have an expression for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.50,0:28:01.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"诱捕命运女神"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Tempting fate."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.53,0:28:01.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.10,0:28:07.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  那你自己小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you just be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.16,0:28:14.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是乔  西海岸又死了30多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Jo. 30 more dead on the West Coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.54,0:28:16.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这兄弟俩到底知道自己要干什么不\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly do those boys think they're gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.00,0:28:20.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们俩啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.34,0:28:22.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要说有谁能救他们  也只有他俩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anybody can pull this out of their ass, it's those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.54,0:28:25.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有听过"命中注定"这说法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you ever hear the saying "You can't stop fate"?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.90,0:28:30.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说  最利落的解决办法就是让船沉没\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, cleanest fix would just be to sink the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.81,0:28:32.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么能这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.87,0:28:34.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为现在那些人都一个个惨死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, because, right now they're all dying bloody.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.53,0:28:36.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这跟他们从未出生可不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the same as never being born.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.44,0:28:39.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可都是人命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're talking about people --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.10,0:28:42.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人爱他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}People who are loved...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.55,0:28:45.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也有人会想他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}...who would be missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.31,0:28:51.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哪根筋不对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.07,0:28:52.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.30,0:28:57.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧  此地无银三百两\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please. You are a neon sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.94,0:29:04.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是要我动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I can beat it out of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.01,0:29:06.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是自己交代  你选吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we could just skip that part -- dealer's choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.22,0:29:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以不只有我  乔也是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, not just me, but Jo, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.46,0:29:30.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不会让船沉没的  我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not gonna sink the boat. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.11,0:29:34.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,船在  你就不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boat stays. You don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.26,0:29:40.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果命运本该如此  那\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it was meant to be, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.21,0:29:42.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜是祸躲不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess whatever happens, happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.61,0:29:45.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以说啊  没什么"命中注定"\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's just my point. Nothing's "Meant to be."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.03,0:29:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们分开与否全在一个混蛋天使一时兴起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether we're together is at the whim of some dick angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.99,0:29:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Bobby, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.23,0:29:51.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.41,0:29:54.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.83,0:29:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.77,0:30:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.78,0:30:21.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们随时都会遭遇"命运的邂逅"  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, we're just gonna meet our fate at any time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.20,0:30:23.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.57,0:30:25.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续走  自然点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just walk. Act natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.60,0:30:36.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.88,0:30:37.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.32,0:31:09.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是坑爹呢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.25,0:31:17.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  继续  走着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, just -- just keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.79,0:31:28.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  他们在耍刀呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, they're juggling knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.27,0:31:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还有短斧  -我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And hatchets. - Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.83,0:31:38.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是祸躲不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't avoid fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.18,0:32:03.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.79,0:32:04.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也没明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't either.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.58,0:32:06.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都送上门儿了  怎么还不动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you got to kill to get killed around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.04,0:32:08.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许小卡想错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Cass was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.60,0:32:09.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.24,0:32:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.52,0:32:41.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿特洛波斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atropos.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.62,0:32:44.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,气色不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look well.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.38,0:32:47.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多亏了你啊  我现在屁都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look like stomped-over crap, because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.81,0:32:49.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.11,0:32:51.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谈  谈什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk? About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.51,0:32:53.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谈你和你的这两只马戏团小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe about how you and those two circus clowns
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.65,0:32:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是如何破坏我的工作的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}destroyed my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.93,0:32:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们毁掉了我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ruined my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.50,0:32:57.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not get emotional.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.97,0:32:59.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么不要激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not get emotional?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.76,0:33:01.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.24,0:33:02.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,承蒙上帝安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}God gave me a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.99,0:33:04.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应各司其职\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all had a script.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.36,0:33:06.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我辛勤工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.76,0:33:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还干得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was really, really good at what I did...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.93,0:33:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到晴天霹雳从天而降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until the day of the big prize fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.00,0:33:15.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么呢  你破坏了一切秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what happens? You throw out the book!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.06,0:33:17.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.31,0:33:20.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但自由价更高\N{\fnArial\fs30}But freedom is more preferable.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.13,0:33:23.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自由  这是混乱  哪里好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freedom? This is chaos! How is it better?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.30,0:33:25.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至上天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I even went to heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.67,0:33:27.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只为得到下一步的行动指示  可是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to ask what to do next, and you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.78,0:33:29.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都没人跟我搭话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one would even talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.09,0:33:31.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家手边都有更紧迫的事要处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are more pressing matters at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.56,0:33:33.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我不知道接下来会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't know what happens next.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.51,0:33:35.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要知道  这是我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know. It's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.52,0:33:36.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.54,0:33:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你被解雇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your services are no longer required.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.96,0:33:45.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.11,0:33:47.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直闭口不谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've kept my mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.96,0:33:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以怨声载道  我可以小题大做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have complained, I could have raised a fuss,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.65,0:33:51.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.35,0:33:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可你知道底线是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what the last straw is?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.16,0:33:57.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拯救泰坦尼克号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Un-sinking the Titanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.22,0:34:00.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你改变了未来  但不能重写历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}You changed the future. You cannot change the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.29,0:34:01.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is going too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.62,0:34:03.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是巴尔萨泽干的  他不受控制  -狗屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Balthazar. He's erratic -- - Bull crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.59,0:34:06.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟那部破电影根本没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't about some stupid movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.89,0:34:08.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他听命于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's under your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.09,0:34:11.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你派他拯救了那艘游轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent him back to save that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.92,0:34:14.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.37,0:34:16.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.31,0:34:18.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是因为你身陷战争之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, maybe because you're in the middle of a war
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.51,0:34:19.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能孤注一掷\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're desperate?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.15,0:34:23.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧  明明就是为了那些灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. This is about the souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.50,0:34:26.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直是一派胡言\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.86,0:34:28.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个天使为你们的战争机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}That angel went and create
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.62,0:34:31.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,增添了5万灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}50,000 new souls for your war machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.36,0:34:34.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.19,0:34:36.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.02,0:34:39.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能这样快速增员  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just mint money, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.28,0:34:41.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是不道德的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.95,0:34:43.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是危险的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dangerous...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.65,0:34:44.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让你得逞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.83,0:34:52.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有选择的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.34,0:34:53.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我是没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.19,0:34:55.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我可以让你选\N{\fnArial\fs30}So here's a choice for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.15,0:34:58.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不回到过去  让那艘船沉没\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't go back and sink that boat,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.59,0:35:02.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会杀了你最中意的两个小宠物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill your two favorite pets.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.47,0:35:06.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让你得逞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.56,0:35:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  你能拿我怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.74,0:35:10.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别把我逼急了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really want to test me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.46,0:35:14.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.34,0:35:16.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你要知道...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But think about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.59,0:35:19.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有两位姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got two sisters out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.86,0:35:22.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们比我大  而且不仅是在年龄方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're bigger, in every sense of the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.12,0:35:24.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.73,0:35:26.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆和迪恩会是她们的首要目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean are target one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.16,0:35:28.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纯粹是为了报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}For simple vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.79,0:35:34.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你目前没在忙着打仗什么的  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not fighting a war or anything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.60,0:35:36.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以夜以继日  寸步不离地保护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can watch them every millisecond of every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.31,0:35:39.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你可能听说过...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because maybe you've heard...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.17,0:35:43.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命运总会在最不经意时眷顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fate strikes when you least expect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.38,0:35:46.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴尔萨泽  住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balthazar, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.62,0:35:50.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尴尬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.08,0:35:53.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快把事情矫正回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set things right
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.02,0:35:56.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我就按规矩  把你的两个小心肝做掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I flick your precious boys off a cliff just on principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.23,0:35:58.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  在我们走之前...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sweetie, before we go, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.11,0:35:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以帮你把那树枝拿走...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could remove that stick from your...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.50,0:36:01.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别逼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.88,0:36:03.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还是留着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. We'll leave it inserted, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.67,0:36:08.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.06,0:36:12.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱去把泰坦尼克号搞沉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's sink the Titanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.45,0:36:54.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们儿  几点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, what time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.75,0:36:59.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚做了个超级诡异的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I just had the weirdest dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.40,0:37:02.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赌20块  我的更诡异  不开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}20 bucks says mine was weirder. I am not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.48,0:37:03.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我也没开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I'm not kidding, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.71,0:37:05.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个梦...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I mean, it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.41,0:37:07.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}just bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.24,0:37:09.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我梦到真正的泰坦尼克号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine had the actual Titanic in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.74,0:37:12.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.73,0:37:14.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我脸上有脏东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something on my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.79,0:37:18.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它是不是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}D-did it, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.11,0:37:20.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...没沉\N{\fnArial\fs30}...not sink,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.78,0:37:21.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为巴尔萨泽\N{\fnArial\fs30}because Balthazar...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.97,0:37:23.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.97,0:37:23.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不喜欢比利·赞恩(《泰坦尼克》中露丝的未婚夫)吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}had a hate on for Billy Zane?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.77,0:37:26.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱俩的梦怎么一模一样  哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you having my dreams, dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.31,0:37:27.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是个梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.84,0:37:30.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.28,0:37:34.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说这些事真的发生过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying this actually happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.69,0:37:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这整件...事情都是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That t-the whole... whatever -- t-that was real?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.79,0:37:38.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.95,0:37:41.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  那到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. So, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.60,0:37:44.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我坚持要他及时回到过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I insisted he go back in time
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.43,0:37:45.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,修正他的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}and correct what he'd done.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.86,0:37:46.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.59,0:37:48.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.04,0:37:50.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这样才能确保你们的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the only way to be sure you were safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.52,0:37:55.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.87,0:37:59.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说你为了我们...  杀了5万人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you killed... 50,000 people for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.80,0:38:05.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有  因为他们从未出生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't. They were never born.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.66,0:38:10.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这和被杀截然不同  难道不是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's far different from being killed, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.33,0:38:18.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃伦和乔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen and Jo?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.40,0:38:26.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.00,0:38:33.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.59,0:38:39.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们回去修正了历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if you guys went a-and changed everything back,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.03,0:38:44.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那以前的时间轴就被抹去了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}then that whole timeline or whatever, it just got erased?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.68,0:38:46.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. More or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.40,0:38:49.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那为什么我们俩还记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, how come he and I remember it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.79,0:38:51.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我希望你们能记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I wanted you to remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.61,0:38:52.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.49,0:38:56.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你们看清命运的本来面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted you to know who fate really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.72,0:38:58.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她既残酷又无常\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's cruel and capricious.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.35,0:38:59.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我说就是"贱人"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd go so far as "bitch".
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.53,0:39:01.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.25,0:39:03.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你们教会了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the ones who taught me
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.67,0:39:06.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命运掌握在自己手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you can make your own destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.24,0:39:09.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不必受命运的掌控\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be ruled by fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.31,0:39:12.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以选择自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can choose freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.75,0:39:16.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我仍相信那是值得为之拼搏的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still believe that that's something worth fighting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.92,0:39:20.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想让你们明白这个道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted you to understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.64,0:39:26.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.22,0:39:29.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴尔萨泽真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did...Balthazar really, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.03,0:39:32.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就因为一部言情片  弄出这么大动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}unravel the sweater over a chick flick?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.06,0:39:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.38,0:39:37.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  他就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely. That's what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.53,0:39:40.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不该让他再看电视了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Well, might be time to take away his cable privileges.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.54,0:39:43.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说了  《泰坦尼克》也没那么烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, "Titanic" didn't suck that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.41,0:39:46.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温斯莱特胸很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winslet's rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.54,0:39:52.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡有一个特点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you one thing about Cass,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.63,0:39:54.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不懂得欣赏美好的事物\N{\fnArial\fs30}he does not appreciate the finer things.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.38,0:40:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都恢复正常了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess things are back to normal, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.42,0:40:13.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"正常"  太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Normal". Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.90,0:40:17.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.00,0:40:20.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至都不知道自己曾经那么幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't even know how good he had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.60,0:40:22.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知情就不会难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, what he doesn't know won't hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.31,0:40:23.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们最好不要告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we keep our mouths shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.77,0:40:25.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.42,0:40:27.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要叫醒他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we wake him?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.37,0:40:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.37,0:40:32.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这大概是他一周以来最舒服的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's probably the best he's felt all week.
